{
  "title": "加快数字中国建设，为中国式现代化注入强大动力",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>10</span><font>2024.05</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>加快数字中国建设，为中国式现代化注入强大动力</h2> <b>2024.05.10</b> <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; text-align: left;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</b>随着信息技术的迅猛发展，数字化已经成为推动国家现代化进程的重要力量。数字中国建设不仅关乎经济发展，还涉及政治、文化、社会、生态等多个领域，是实现全面现代化的关键所在。因此，加快数字中国建设，对于推动中国式现代化具有重大的战略意义。<br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700;\">一、数字中国建设的战略意义</span></p><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px 0px 0px 32px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">推动经济高质量发展</span>：数字化技术能够深度融合到各个产业中，提升生产效率，优化资源配置，实现经济结构的转型升级。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">提升国家治理能力</span>：数字技术为政府决策提供了更为精准的数据支持，有助于实现精准治理、科学决策，提高治理效能。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">丰富文化生活</span>：数字技术的运用使得文化传播更加便捷，丰富了人们的精神文化生活，提升了文化软实力。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">改善民生福祉</span>：数字化服务能够更好地满足人民群众的需求，提升公共服务水平，增强人民群众的获得感、幸福感、安全感。</p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700;\">二、数字中国建设的重点任务</span></p><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px 0px 0px 32px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">夯实数字基础设施</span>：加快5G、物联网、工业互联网等新型基础设施建设，提升网络覆盖和服务能力。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">促进数据资源流动</span>：完善数据要素基础制度，推进数据资源高效利用，释放数据要素价值。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">推动数字经济与实体经济深度融合</span>：加快传统产业数字化转型，培育壮大新兴数字产业，构建现代化经济体系。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">提升数字政府建设水平</span>：推动政府数字化转型，提升公共服务效率和质量，增强政府公信力。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">加强数字文化建设</span>：推动数字技术与文化产业的深度融合，丰富文化产品和服务供给，提升文化产业的竞争力。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">保障数字安全</span>：完善数字安全法律法规体系，提升数字安全防护能力，维护国家数字安全。</p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700;\">三、加快数字中国建设的路径</span></p><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px 0px 0px 32px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">加强顶层设计和统筹协调</span>：制定数字中国建设整体规划，明确发展目标、重点任务和保障措施，确保各项工作有序推进。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">发挥企业主体作用</span>：鼓励企业加大研发投入，推动技术创新和应用，培育具有国际竞争力的数字企业。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">加强人才培养和引进</span>：完善人才培养体系，培养一批高素质的数字人才；同时，积极引进海外优秀人才，为数字中国建设提供智力支持。</p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">深化国际合作与交流</span>：加强与国际先进国家在数字领域的合作与交流，共同推动全球数字治理体系的完善。</p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\">加快数字中国建设是推动中国式现代化的重要举措。通过夯实数字基础设施、促进数据资源流动、推动数字经济与实体经济深度融合等措施的实施，将有力推动我国经济社会的数字化转型升级，为实现全面建设社会主义现代化国家的目标注入强大动力。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\">万里数据库始终专注国产自主可控数据库产品研发，拥有发明专利、软件著作权百余项，为企事业单位用户提供<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(180, 21, 28);\">“极致稳定、极致性能、极致易用”</span></strong>的数据库产品与服务，打造的<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(192, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: justify; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">万里安全数据库GreatDB及全新一站式行业解决方案，</strong>已为</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">金融、运营商、能源、政府、交通</strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\">等行业重要业务系统中的<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(180, 21, 28);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">超1000 个</strong></span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\">应用场景提供一站式数据库产品与解决方案。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">万里数据库也将继续怀揣初心，始终投身国产数据库的产品化研发与产业化推广事业，专注打磨数据库产品和技术服务水平，助力我国数据库产业高质量发展，共筑数字经济底座，为我国数字经济发展做出更大贡献。</span></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
